hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1625","Narrated to us Qutaybah ibn Sa‘īd: Narrated to us Ya‘qūb ibn Abd al-Raḥmān al-Qarqasānī, on the authority of Suhayl ibn Sa‘d (RA) who said:\nAbu Bakr (RA) was once going out to the Banū ‘Amr to mediate between them. He said to Bilāl (RA), “When the time for prayer comes and I have not returned, then instruct Abu Bakr (RA) to lead the people in prayer.”\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
